    <string name="about_upstream">LumenRead is a fork of LLMersion-1, the open-source reference implementation of the LLMersion scheme (Guo et al., arXiv:2609.29672): a local-first AI framework for low-cost home language learning. Source: github.com/QM378/LLMersion</string>
